OL,3,GNEWSAEye care centre offering free
OL,4,Aappointments opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new #7.7m eye care treatment centre
OL,7,Foffering free appointments has opened.
OL,9,FThe Centre for Eyecare Excellence,
OL,10,Fbased at Hepworth House on the
OL,11,FUniversity of Plymouth's campus, is an
OL,12,Fexpanded version of a previous clinic
OL,13,Fon Gibbon Street in Devon.
OL,15,FIt includes 34 treatment rooms,
OL,16,Fteaching areas and research
OL,17,Flaboratories, allowing optometry
OL,18,Fstudents to treat patients under
OL,19,Fsupervision using industry standard
OL,20,Fequipment, said clinicians.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
