OL,3,GNEWSAEye care centre offering free
OL,4,Aappointments opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FClinical lead optometrist Jodie Burke
OL,7,Fsaid the centre would benefit both
OL,8,Fpatients and students, with treatments
OL,9,Foffered including glaucoma, contact
OL,10,Flens appointments and general
OL,11,Fappointments.
